# The backdrop behind a pane: the default grain, then each kind picked in Settings ▸ Appearance,
# and the Appearance page whose Backdrop tiles pick them.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer paneBackdrop theme
project storefront shop
chat Flint
title "Fix the rounding in cart totals"
say "shell pnpm test"
settle 6
front Flint
settle 2
snap grain
prefer paneBackdrop gradient
settle 2
snap gradient
prefer paneBackdrop stars
settle 2
snap stars
prefer paneBackdrop grid
settle 2
snap grid
prefer paneBackdrop theme
settings Appearance
settle 2
snap settings
